  "date": "February 5, 2007",
  "content": "I awoke that day feeling like there was a danger, like I had to leave my house. When I left the house that morning of 2/5/2007, I first drove to another store. Then on a whim, I decided to go instead to the Foodland. If I had stayed home, where I live alone and the cardiac arrest had happened, I would not have survived. If I had stayed at the first grocery store and the cardiac arrest had happened there, my chances of surviving it wouldn't have been very good. My intuition had put me in a place where I could be saved.",
